WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.392
The judge moved to another stall in the market.

2
00:00:07.393 --> 00:00:10.027
Mazatl stared dreamily.

3
00:00:10.028 --> 00:00:14.072
"I wish I could be a judge someday," he sighed.

4
00:00:14.073 --> 00:00:17.332
"Maybe you can," Vinnie said.

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:19.611
Mazatl shook his head.

6
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:23.149
"Papa is a farmer, so I will be one too.

7
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.222
Judges come from rich homes.

8
00:00:25.223 --> 00:00:27.200
I do not."

9
00:00:27.201 --> 00:00:30.357
"That’s not fair," said Vinnie.

10
00:00:30.358 --> 00:00:32.318
Mazatl shrugged.

11
00:00:32.318 --> 00:00:35.021
"Only the gods can direct your life.

12
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:37.872
I was meant to be a farmer, I guess."

13
00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:40.923
Vinnie felt sorry for Mazatl.

14
00:00:40.924 --> 00:00:45.375
Mandy noticed that the Aztec people didn’t use money.

15
00:00:45.376 --> 00:00:49.436
They traded things they had for the things they needed.

16
00:00:49.437 --> 00:00:53.084
She remembered the man selling cocoa beans.

17
00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:58.382
"Are cocoa beans worth much?" Mandy asked.

18
00:00:58.383 --> 00:01:00.086
Mazatl nodded.

19
00:01:00.087 --> 00:01:03.043
"We use cocoa beans to make a chocolate drink.

20
00:01:03.044 --> 00:01:04.561
It’s our favorite.

21
00:01:04.562 --> 00:01:07.601
But it is too costly for my family."

22
00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:10.245
That gave Mandy an idea.

23
00:01:10.246 --> 00:01:16.129
As Mazatl and Vinnie walked along, Mandy went to the cocoa bean seller.

24
00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:21.253
"Sir, I would like to buy your beans," she said.

25
00:01:21.254 --> 00:01:23.654
He looked at her and laughed.

26
00:01:23.655 --> 00:01:27.428
"What will you give me, little girl?" he asked.

27
00:01:27.429 --> 00:01:32.216
"Something very precious," she said bravely.

28
00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:37.881
The bean seller looked at her coldly. "Show me."

29
00:01:37.882 --> 00:01:40.806
Mandy held out her arm.

30
00:01:40.807 --> 00:01:43.606
Her bead bracelet sparkled.

31
00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:46.066
The man’s eyes grew greedy.

32
00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:49.147
"Where did you get that?" he demanded.

33
00:01:49.148 --> 00:01:53.079
"From a faraway land," she replied.

34
00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.815
The man stared and then handed over the beans.

35
00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.675
Mandy gave him the bracelet.

36
00:01:59.676 --> 00:02:04.614
"Good day, sir," she said, and ran to find her brother.

37
00:02:04.615 --> 00:02:08.757
Vinnie and Mazatl were going to meet Mazatl’s papa.

38
00:02:08.758 --> 00:02:13.087
Suddenly, Vinnie heard people cheering and shouting.

39
00:02:13.088 --> 00:02:17.966
Attracted by the sounds, he left Mazatl’s side.

40
00:02:17.967 --> 00:02:24.147
Not far away, Vinnie was amazed to find a large outdoor stadium.

41
00:02:24.148 --> 00:02:28.096
Two teams were playing a game similar to basketball.

42
00:02:28.097 --> 00:02:34.674
The players were trying to get a hard rubber ball into a high hoop.

43
00:02:34.675 --> 00:02:41.005
They did not use their hands or feet, only their elbows, hips, and knees.

44
00:02:41.006 --> 00:02:44.749
"That’s impossible!" Vinnie said.

45
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.340
Then something else caught his eye.

46
00:02:47.341 --> 00:02:50.877
Behind the stadium was a tall tower.

47
00:02:50.878 --> 00:02:56.760
It looked like a pyramid, but the top was flat and had two buildings on it.

48
00:02:56.761 --> 00:03:00.535
Many steps led up to the top of the pyramid.

49
00:03:00.536 --> 00:03:05.867
"I wonder what that is?" he said.

50
00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:10.885
Meanwhile, Mandy found Mazatl near his father’s stall.

51
00:03:10.886 --> 00:03:15.307
She handed him the bag of cocoa beans.

52
00:03:15.308 --> 00:03:19.411
"But how?" Mazatl asked, amazed.

53
00:03:19.412 --> 00:03:23.547
"Please, it is my gift to your family.

54
00:03:23.548 --> 00:03:27.667
You have been so kind to us," she said.

55
00:03:27.668 --> 00:03:30.945
"Who are you?" he asked suddenly.

56
00:03:30.946 --> 00:03:34.141
"You are different from us."

57
00:03:34.142 --> 00:03:38.875
But before she could reply, loud drums began beating.

58
00:03:38.876 --> 00:03:41.539
"Mazatl!" said his father.

59
00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.278
"The sacrifices are about to begin.

60
00:03:44.279 --> 00:03:46.808
Let us go to the temple immediately."

61
00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:48.745
Mandy looked around.

62
00:03:48.746 --> 00:03:50.746
"Where’s Vinnie?" she asked.

